Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.61,0:01:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.53,0:01:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really is my blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the garbage I forgot to take\Nout is here in perfect detail!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.73,0:01:56.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is up with that goddess?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.19,0:01:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't understand\Nwhat this skill is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.89,0:02:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, all I can think about is\Ngetting you back to your place safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.47,0:02:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.49,0:02:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the manner in which she\Ngrants wishes is a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.37,0:02:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sloppy. Well, the water and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.53,0:02:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,electricity both work but the
