Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-black outside still a pretty\Nuseful ability though you know
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.15,0:02:32.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those bites are enormous I'm reminded of a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.05,0:02:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hamster more than anything else well Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at any rate, at least we won't have trouble\Nfinding food or a decent place to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Food will be a problem though, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.71,0:02:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all I have in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.25,0:02:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.01,0:02:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last food?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.55,0:02:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last food.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.01,0:02:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only have one serving?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.95,0:02:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the heck would you\Ncasually eat it right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, I was hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.99,0:03:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have nothing set\Naside for emergencies? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.05,0:03:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I never eat at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.51,0:03:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.43,0:03:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you planning to do if there\Nwere a giant earthquake or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.19,0:03:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew if that happened, you'd\Ncome and save me anyway, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.17,0:03:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're a fault for\Nbeing so overprotective!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.03,0:03:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then hurry up and become\Nindependent, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do have water, so we should\Nbe able to manage for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worst case scenario, we could break\Ndown that bear thing from meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.51,0:03:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm ever gonna\Neat something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.69,0:03:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god, you really are\Nspoiled, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.85,0:03:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, none of this changes\Nwhat we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather information and secure food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should move while we still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.97,0:03:47.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we have to keep\Nhiking up that mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I think we'll be done\Nwith that fairly soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually earlier, while we were\Nbeing chased, I saw some smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.99,0:03:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think there might be\Na settlement that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:03:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aww!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.59,0:04:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so fantasy-esque!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It definitely doesn't look like Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, uh, how can I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will I be okay dressed like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.51,0:04:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could approve, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.51,0:04:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm wearing this\Nbecause I want to, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.31,0:04:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only had these because my sister\Nleft them behind when she visited!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.79,0:04:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.57,0:04:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.79,0:04:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you realize you've been pretty\Ncold to me ever since this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.19,0:04:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been like this.
