Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.85,0:04:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's still hard to look at\Nyou, so you need new clothes ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.37,0:04:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry up and find\Nsome clothes from this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it just as we planned. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.41,0:04:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a rich young lady from a remote region\Nand you're here with me as my attendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:04:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't say why I'm traveling,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.61,0:05:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that explains why I\Ndon't know this area at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.09,0:05:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's all she wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.07,0:05:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure, that sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.73,0:05:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this beauty and my great\Ncommunication skills, I'll be unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can make any man out\Nthere fall in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.43,0:05:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never succeed with women.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.61,0:05:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.71,0:05:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those looks will prove advantageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.27,0:05:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even without knowing the language,\Nit's unlikely things will go poorly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.07,0:05:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana is a good communicator.
