Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.21,0:05:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they having a festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ma 'am, now my clothes are dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.95,0:06:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not hurt, are you, young miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry to bother\Nyou while you're working.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.93,0:06:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I'm a little lost, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, do you maybe not understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.91,0:06:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonjour!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.83,0:06:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.99,0:06:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is...is this...could this be...true love?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.89,0:06:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, uh...is this a dangerous situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a woodcutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.23,0:06:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.39,0:06:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd quit leaving if it were for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.75,0:06:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fully prepared to live a decent life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.85,0:06:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can grow vegetables or\Nsomething, and I want two children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.51,0:07:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that that's settled,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.33,0:07:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get permission from the boss\Nand head back to my home country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, why are you\Nplaying around over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just found myself\Na cute wife! A wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.25,0:07:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you marry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.89,0:07:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.07,0:07:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd quit thieving if it were for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm prepared to live a decent life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can make clay pots or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want eight children.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.69,0:07:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many kids do these\Nguys want me to have?
