Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one steals my wife away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even you, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.59,0:07:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She will spend her life with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This calls for a duel! Marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd quit thieving if it were for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you won't! Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.51,0:07:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all so pointless,\NI'm not gonna marry anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you safe, Tachibana?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.51,0:08:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for my sake, not for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you, don't fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.23,0:08:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, did you do this?\NI haven't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.53,0:08:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all I did was exist but I I they started
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.53,0:08:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fighting Because I'm just too beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.09,0:08:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana you're actually\Nloving this aren't you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you oh beautiful\None thank you and now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.35,0:08:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems I'm being revered\Nlike I'm some kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deity well it's a whole\Nlot healthier than that
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight that broke out\Nearlier I really have become
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.53,0:08:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A woman of such beauty\Nthat I couldn't possibly
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.73,0:08:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,exist I just thought I\Nmight be a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Popular I underestimate\Nit too I think I finally
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:09:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of understand why\Nyou started hating women
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What no because if this\Nstuff happens everywhere I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.05,0:09:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,go that'll be oh maybe I should\Nhide my face Well, does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but some countermeasures\Ndo seem like a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, why\Ndoesn't it affect you, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, you mean why am I fine\Nwhen these guys aren't?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be because I know\Nyou're a man. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly unaffected, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.25,0:09:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's got something to do with the\Nintelligence setting and the parameters?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's got some kind of mental effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.41,0:09:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap! We're defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.39,0:09:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think we'd get wiped\Nout by a lone woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you'd do well to be afraid,\Nbecause we're an advance party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.29,0:09:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, in just a few hours, the main\Ngroup will realize something's wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.79,0:09:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they'll get ready to fight,\Nand then they'll come here for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.41,0:09:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't said a single word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.03,0:09:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're having a\Nconversation with themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:10:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really looking forward\Nto seeing this entire
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,village get crushed into\Nthe ground like a grave!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're close enough to\Nguess something's wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that means their stronghold is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.49,0:10:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are these guys for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.85,0:10:14.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.01,0:10:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you! Tachibana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you give me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really wish you'd tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.95,0:10:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that I'm undefeatable?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.09,0:10:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.17,0:10:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
