Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.79,0:10:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their numbers are low compared to yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.37,0:11:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, we don't know\Nhow far we can trust these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we can't know how many are inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.05,0:11:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll tread carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no fun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.25,0:11:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just smack\Nthem around a little
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bit and finish this up\Nbefore it gets started?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.61,0:11:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took out that beam-shooting\Nbear with one punch, you can do it!
