Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when you were student council\Npresident, you took out a den of delinquents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.13,0:11:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Different danger level entirely!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I didn't take them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just rehabilitated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.65,0:11:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call that rehab?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.73,0:11:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then should I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can you do with those\Ncannon fodder level stats?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.75,0:11:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go thinking that cannon\Nfodder isn't good for anything, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elite.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.01,0:11:42.55,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fnPostregular\fs320\fax.2\bord15\frz-26.42\c&HB853EC&\3c&HB853EC&\move(2200.61,952.24,310,-110,0,524)\blur0.85}Ka-pow
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.01,0:11:42.55,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fnPostregular\fs320\fax.2\bord0\frz-26.42\c&HF8DDFA&\3c&HB853EC&\move(2200.61,952.24,310,-110,0,524)\blur25\alpha&H60&}Ka-pow
Dialogue: 2,0:11:42.01,0:11:42.55,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fnPostregular\fs320\fax.2\bord0\frz-26.42\c&HF8DDFA&\3c&HB853EC&\move(2200.61,952.24,310,-110,0,524)\blur0.85}Ka-pow
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.57,0:11:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I'm gonna go crush\Ntheir group dynamics completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're one of those women.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.09,0:11:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you already forgotten\Nyou were almost kidnapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.59,0:11:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best case, you'd be married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:53.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worst case, they own you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.97,0:11:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say some really scary things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:12:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you just leave this to\Nme and go ahead to your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.85,0:12:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:03.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, it doesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how strong you are, it's not\Ncool letting you go face danger alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.04,0:12:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's this part of you that's so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.25,0:12:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.97,0:12:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So thoughtful and kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.93,0:12:26.14,Signs,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\fnAdega Serif\b1\fs90\bord0.5\blur0.7\c&HEEFFFE&\3c&HEEFFFE&\t(17,225,\c&H96C0D1&\3c&H96C0D1&)\t(267,726,\c&H010002&\3c&H010002&)\pos(1560,288)}Middle School
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.05,0:12:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine, you can leave this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.07,0:12:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can find a way on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make it work
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do things for others be willing to\Nsacrifice yourself to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.31,0:12:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just how I was raised
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never even questioned\Nit, and yet, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're making you handle\Nall the paperwork again
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachi Banna, they're supposed to\Nbe two of you doing this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.93,0:12:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where's the other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.37,0:12:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a team practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.91,0:12:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ran out on you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.51,0:12:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now they're just using\Nyou come on hand him over
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh I'm in the going\Nhome club and when I get
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There I got nothing to\Ndo. I'll help even you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:13:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think these are a pain\Nright I'm so sorry to put
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.79,0:13:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all this on your shoulders\Nyou're just so mature!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguchi I end up relying\Non you sorry I got team
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.93,0:13:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,practice I feel bad but\Nthe tournament's coming up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.93,0:13:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well in that case I'm compiling stats\Nfrom the future plans questionnaires.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's best if you don't ask\Nme to do stuff like statistics.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.83,0:13:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you staple them for me? Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.33,0:13:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.71,0:13:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though he knew it would be a pain,\Nhe couldn't pretend not to notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a person who will do things\Nfor others when it really counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.75,0:13:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of being someone who just\Ndoes as they're told, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.65,0:13:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, he's always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.85,0:13:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what was that\Nreaction just now? Cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.59,0:13:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess that's\Nacceptable, but marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.49,0:14:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.97,0:14:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too soon to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.25,0:14:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't even dated yet
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.49,0:14:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.41,0:14:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting worse by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My thoughts are filled with Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.79,0:14:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this the curse, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You good, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.89,0:14:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, if I catch\Neven a glimpse, I might...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, looks like it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.49,0:14:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuts on the forehead really\Nbleed a ton, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tachibana, you're just so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.23,0:14:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.39,0:14:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.93,0:15:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an enemy raid!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.91,0:15:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.27,0:15:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should cherish yourself more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.83,0:15:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is your chest so recklessly exposed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.65,0:15:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if you catch a chill?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, it's not like I want\Nto dress like this, you weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.79,0:15:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, falling out between comrades?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only two of them, and\None of them is actually a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.93,0:15:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we didn't need to\Ncall everyone out here after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.99,0:15:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, gents, the woman's\Nquite a looker, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.69,0:15:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems she takes care of herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We lucked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the woman alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.07,0:15:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No little! Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch my comrades! Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.75,0:15:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinda looks like he's planting\Nrice paddies. Garnish!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.57,0:15:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Be brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.09,0:16:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have convinced the people of\Nthe village to come to your aid!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.95,0:16:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.93,0:16:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from Tachibana!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're acting like a\Ntotal weirdo right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.75,0:16:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.47,0:16:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true. Something isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's burned into my\Neyes, I can't unsee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's burned into your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.47,0:16:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your... Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.31,0:16:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's kinda...
