Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.61,0:17:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your hair is so soft and\Nbeautiful, and the way it shines,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even at night it illuminates your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.55,0:17:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like, since the\Nchange, you are my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People can't even control their\Nown thoughts and feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.99,0:17:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this how the charmed effect works?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, the power of my\Nlooks is way too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do something before anything\Nreally bad happens. Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.33,0:18:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Jinguuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.49,0:18:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I was in a panic, but I think\NI may have slapped you too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I have to take some\Nresponsibility for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More importantly.
