Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're better?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.15,0:18:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.81,0:18:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be so hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.01,0:18:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never experienced a\Ndisgrace of this magnitude!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a blunder?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.11,0:18:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drink up, here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.69,0:18:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really need to come up\Nwith some countermeasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not get slapped again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting better after being hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you're like a broken television.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.51,0:18:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.73,0:18:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.13,0:18:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no use crying over spilled milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we switch gears. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.81,0:18:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get drunk on the taste of victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you just look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.37,0:19:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think it might be\Nthe currency of this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.71,0:19:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but they've\Nhoarded quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.85,0:19:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think we\Nshould do with this booty?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:10.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you should have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.95,0:19:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd like you to accept\Nit as our tribute to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please say you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.49,0:19:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I can't say we\Ndidn't hope for compensation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:25.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's pretty clear that all of this\Nmust have been pillaged from this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.35,0:19:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the saviors of our village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.01,0:19:30.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you allow us to repay you? Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.55,0:19:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you put it that\Nway, it's hard to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.09,0:19:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! In that case, I've just\Nthought of something I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's totally modest and\Nit fits me like a glove.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.05,0:19:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, some new clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguji, you're doing this\Nto save face, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's part of being vulnerable\Nto my charms, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.29,0:20:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.27,0:20:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He plays it so cool, but inside he\Nfinds me so cute he can't even stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.53,0:20:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.23,0:20:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea being this cute could\Nmake a person feel omnipotent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.91,0:20:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.85,0:20:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.99,0:20:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure it's a bummer knowing\Nsomeone's figured out your weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.83,0:20:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it's a good thing that it's\Nonly me, then, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.13,0:20:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hunt, do you smell something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.17,0:20:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.19,0:20:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jinguuji, this is bad!\NFire! There's a fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.85,0:20:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jinguuji!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.45,0:21:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, someone's\Nfigured out my weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.29,0:21:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the first time\Nthis has happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.57,0:21:10.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.67,0:21:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not the time to be\Nbasking in your emotions!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.45,0:21:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.35,0:21:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satayna, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.69,0:21:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As beautiful as ever, lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.53,0:21:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Premier, um?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're as lovely as ever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.25,0:21:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of hearing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.29,0:21:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that isn't well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.77,0:21:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's get out there and work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.63,0:21:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Premier, we shall work for the sake\Nof this beautiful elven forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.53,0:22:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a TOTALLY BURN TO THE GROUND!
